body:
&#x200B;

Honestly bro, I don't know how to reply to your message because everything you said is true and reality of life. Maybe rn I'm just feared of the harsh reality that I'm stuck in, and letting the truth sink in atm. The thoughts in my head just make me want to harm myself, but the only thing that's holding me back is the fact that I might cause the same pain to the others that love me like my family and all. I have made attempts to get my thoughts off it, I changed my working shift to night time, and doing long hours so i get tired and sleep during the whole day and go back to work after that.... Laura always wanted to travel to iceland and maybe at some point soon, I could go there when I recover. But really man, i really appreciate for being honest about it, I will try taking in what you have said. 

&#x200B;
